ple from my life i love  business i love entrepreneurship  i love famous entrepreneurs in their  success story  and i love dancing i do a lot of salsa  dancing  i'm dancing i'm djing i'm doing that 20  25 hours a week  it's a good part-time job doing dancing  and i can keep it as separate  you know here's evan the businessman and  then evan  the salsa guy but the real  power comes from combining that  so i've invested into a salsa company  and i'll dj there  and i bring my knowledge of business to  help that company and i bring my  knowledge of salsa  and dancing and art to help my business  i'm more fulfilled i'm happier and i  have more success  in my business life because i brought  more of myself to what i do  so empower and embrace the genius of the  end  don't force yourself to pick between  this and this  that are both important to you the real  power the real connection is going to  come  from combining those and you'll have  much  greater success in whatever you end up  doing  believe for those of you watching if you  liked the video please give it a thumbs  up below it makes you want to do more  for you  and i'd love to hear what you have to  think about this video please leave a  comment underneath  and if you have a question for your own  business leave in the comment section  below and i will make a video response  for you guys thank you for tuning in and  i'll see you soon
 

